                <pb facs="0561" n="437" sameAs="frus:frus1881/pg437"/>

                <head>No. 264.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Morton to Mr. Blaine</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Paris</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1881-11-25"><hi rendition="#italic">November</hi> 25,
                        1881</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Informed chairman committee of Chamber; says bill for microscopic examination
                    pork will be withdrawn. The training of microscopic inspectors has been
                    suspended.</p>
                <closer><signed>MORTON.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
